---
// Realtime Collaborative Architecture Diagram: OT vs CRDT
---

<figure class="collab-diagram" aria-labelledby="collab-caption">
  <svg
    class="collab-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 450"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="collab-title collab-desc"
  >
    <title id="collab-title">
      即時多人協作架構拓撲：OT 中心化轉換 vs. CRDT 分散式因果收斂
    </title>
    <desc id="collab-desc">
      展示兩種協作模型架構：左側 Operational Transformation
      依賴單一權威伺服器進行版本矩陣操作轉換；右側 CRDT 透過不可變
      ID、因果半格與 Yjs 雙向鏈表在去中心化節點間實現確定性收斂。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="collab-arrow-ot"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="collab-diagram__arrow-ot"></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="collab-arrow-crdt"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="collab-diagram__arrow-crdt"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Side A: OT Architecture -->
    <g class="collab-diagram__card" transform="translate(30, 30)">
      <rect width="430" height="380" rx="12"></rect>
      <text
        class="collab-diagram__badge collab-diagram__badge--amber"
        x="20"
        y="30"
      >
        CENTRALIZED TRANSFORMATION (OT)
      </text>
      <text class="collab-diagram__title" x="20" y="58"
        >操作轉換架構（Google Docs 模式）</text
      >

      <!-- Client A -->
      <g transform="translate(20, 80)">
        <rect
          width="180"
          height="70"
          rx="8"
          class="collab-diagram__subcard collab-diagram__subcard--amber"></rect>
        <text class="collab-diagram__subhead" x="12" y="24"
          >Client 1 (本地輸入)</text
        >
        <text class="collab-diagram__code" x="12" y="44"
          >op1 = insert(pos: 3, 'A')</text
        >
        <text class="collab-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="60"
          >本地樂觀渲染 (rev=0)</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Client B -->
      <g transform="translate(230, 80)">
        <rect
          width="180"
          height="70"
          rx="8"
          class="collab-diagram__subcard collab-diagram__subcard--amber"></rect>
        <text class="collab-diagram__subhead" x="12" y="24"
          >Client 2 (本地輸入)</text
        >
        <text class="collab-diagram__code" x="12" y="44"
          >op2 = delete(pos: 2)</text
        >
        <text class="collab-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="60"
          >本地樂觀渲染 (rev=0)</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Server Coordinator -->
      <g transform="translate(60, 200)">
        <rect
          width="310"
          height="100"
          rx="8"
          class="collab-diagram__subcard collab-diagram__subcard--server"
        ></rect>
        <text
          class="collab-diagram__server-title"
          x="155"
          y="28"
          text-anchor="middle">中心化協調伺服器 (Central Coordinator)</text
        >
        <text
          class="collab-diagram__server-desc"
          x="155"
          y="50"
          text-anchor="middle">依序排隊執行轉換函數：T(op1, op2)</text
        >
        <text
          class="collab-diagram__code-center"
          x="155"
          y="70"
          text-anchor="middle">op1' = insert(pos: 2, 'A') ｜ rev=1</text
        >
        <text
          class="collab-diagram__server-note"
          x="155"
          y="88"
          text-anchor="middle"
          >單一權威定序 ｜ 狀態向量膨脹 ｜ 轉換複雜度 O(N²)</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Connection Arrows -->
      <path
        d="M 110 150 L 160 200"
        class="collab-diagram__line collab-diagram__line--ot"
        marker-end="url(#collab-arrow-ot)"></path>
      <path
        d="M 320 150 L 270 200"
        class="collab-diagram__line collab-diagram__line--ot"
        marker-end="url(#collab-arrow-ot)"></path>
      <path
        d="M 160 300 L 110 350"
        class="collab-diagram__line collab-diagram__line--ot"
        marker-end="url(#collab-arrow-ot)"></path>
      <path
        d="M 270 300 L 320 350"
        class="collab-diagram__line collab-diagram__line--ot"
        marker-end="url(#collab-arrow-ot)"></path>

      <!-- Convergence State -->
      <g transform="translate(85, 330)">
        <rect
          width="260"
          height="35"
          rx="6"
          class="collab-diagram__pill collab-diagram__pill--amber"></rect>
        <text
          class="collab-diagram__pill-text"
          x="130"
          y="22"
          text-anchor="middle">最終一致收斂（依賴中心鎖定定序）</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Side B: CRDT Architecture -->
    <g class="collab-diagram__card" transform="translate(500, 30)">
      <rect width="430" height="380" rx="12"></rect>
      <text
        class="collab-diagram__badge collab-diagram__badge--cyan"
        x="20"
        y="30"
      >
        DECENTRALIZED REPLICATION (CRDT)
      </text>
      <text class="collab-diagram__title" x="20" y="58"
        >無衝突複製資料型態（Yjs / Figma 模式）</text
      >

      <!-- Peer A -->
      <g transform="translate(20, 80)">
        <rect
          width="180"
          height="85"
          rx="8"
          class="collab-diagram__subcard collab-diagram__subcard--cyan"></rect>
        <text class="collab-diagram__subhead" x="12" y="22"
          >Peer 1 (客戶端節點)</text
        >
        <text class="collab-diagram__code" x="12" y="42"
          >ID: &lt;client1, clock=1&gt;</text
        >
        <text class="collab-diagram__code" x="12" y="58"
          >Left: ID_origin, Val: 'A'</text
        >
        <text class="collab-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="74"
          >不可變項目，無需座標平移</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Peer B -->
      <g transform="translate(230, 80)">
        <rect
          width="180"
          height="85"
          rx="8"
          class="collab-diagram__subcard collab-diagram__subcard--cyan"></rect>
        <text class="collab-diagram__subhead" x="12" y="22"
          >Peer 2 (客戶端節點)</text
        >
        <text class="collab-diagram__code" x="12" y="42"
          >ID: &lt;client2, clock=1&gt;</text
        >
        <text class="collab-diagram__code" x="12" y="58"
          >Left: ID_origin, Val: 'B'</text
        >
        <text class="collab-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="74"
          >不可變項目，無需座標平移</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Convergence Core -->
      <g transform="translate(45, 200)">
        <rect
          width="340"
          height="100"
          rx="8"
          class="collab-diagram__subcard collab-diagram__subcard--crdt-core"
        ></rect>
        <text
          class="collab-diagram__core-title"
          x="170"
          y="26"
          text-anchor="middle">半格數學合流（Join-Semilattice Merge）</text
        >
        <text
          class="collab-diagram__core-desc"
          x="170"
          y="48"
          text-anchor="middle"
          >交換律 (Commutative) ｜ 結合律 (Associative) ｜ 冪等律 (Idempotent)</text
        >
        <text
          class="collab-diagram__code-center"
          x="170"
          y="68"
          text-anchor="middle"
          >仲裁規則：client1 &gt; client2 ➔ [ID_origin, 'A', 'B']</text
        >
        <text
          class="collab-diagram__core-note"
          x="170"
          y="88"
          text-anchor="middle"
          >去中心化合併 ｜ 任意亂序抵達皆能收斂 ｜ 支援 P2P / 離線分叉</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- P2P / Relay Sync Arrows -->
      <path
        d="M 110 165 L 150 200"
        class="collab-diagram__line collab-diagram__line--crdt"
        marker-end="url(#collab-arrow-crdt)"></path>
      <path
        d="M 320 165 L 280 200"
        class="collab-diagram__line collab-diagram__line--crdt"
        marker-end="url(#collab-arrow-crdt)"></path>
      <path
        d="M 170 300 L 110 335"
        class="collab-diagram__line collab-diagram__line--crdt"
        marker-end="url(#collab-arrow-crdt)"></path>
      <path
        d="M 260 300 L 320 335"
        class="collab-diagram__line collab-diagram__line--crdt"
        marker-end="url(#collab-arrow-crdt)"></path>

      <!-- Convergence State -->
      <g transform="translate(85, 330)">
        <rect
          width="260"
          height="35"
          rx="6"
          class="collab-diagram__pill collab-diagram__pill--cyan"></rect>
        <text
          class="collab-diagram__pill-text"
          x="130"
          y="22"
          text-anchor="middle">強最終一致性（Strong Eventual Consistency）</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile Layout: Vertical Stacking -->
  <div class="collab-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="collab-mobile-card collab-mobile-card--amber">
      <span class="collab-mobile-badge collab-mobile-badge--amber"
        >模式一：中心化操作轉換 (OT)</span
      >
      <h4>Google Docs / Etherpad 經典模式</h4>
      <p>
        <strong>痛點</strong
        >：依賴中心伺服器作為唯一定序仲裁者。當多人並發輸入，伺服器必須對每個操作執行狀態向量比對與平移轉換
        <code>T(op1, op2)</code>。
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>工程瓶頸</strong>：當編輯者增加，轉換矩陣複雜度暴增至 <code
          >O(N²)</code
        >，且無法原生支援去中心化 P2P 或複雜富文字區塊的離線分叉合併。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="collab-mobile-arrow">VS.</div>

    <div class="collab-mobile-card collab-mobile-card--cyan">
      <span class="collab-mobile-badge collab-mobile-badge--cyan"
        >模式二：無衝突複製資料型態 (CRDT)</span
      >
      <h4>Figma / Yjs / Automerge 現代標準</h4>
      <p>
        <strong>破局點</strong>：為每個文字或畫布圖元賦予全域唯一、不可變的因果
        ID <code>&lt;ClientID, Clock&gt;</code>，捨棄字串相對座標。
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>數學保證</strong>：合併滿足<strong
          >交換律、結合律與冪等律</strong
        >。任何節點不論以何種先後順序或網路延遲收到更新，本地執行 Merge
        必定收斂至完全相同的狀態，天然支援 P2P 與離線重連。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="collab-caption">
    圖 1：即時多人協作的核心架構分水嶺——OT 的中心化座標平移轉換 vs. CRDT
    的數學半格強最終一致收斂。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .collab-diagram {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .collab-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .collab-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* SVG Base Styling */
  .collab-diagram__card > rect {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }

  .collab-diagram__badge {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .collab-diagram__badge--amber {
    fill: #d97706;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .collab-diagram__badge--amber {
    fill: #fbbf24;
  }
  .collab-diagram__badge--cyan {
    fill: #0284c7;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .collab-diagram__badge--cyan {
    fill: #38bdf8;
  }

  .collab-diagram__title {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  .collab-diagram__subcard {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1px;
  }
  .collab-diagram__subcard--amber {
    stroke: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.3);
  }
  .collab-diagram__subcard--cyan {
    stroke: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.3);
  }
  .collab-diagram__subcard--server {
    fill: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.04);
    stroke: #d97706;
    stroke-width: 1.2px;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .collab-diagram__subcard--server {
    fill: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.05);
    stroke: #fbbf24;
  }
  .collab-diagram__subcard--crdt-core {
    fill: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.04);
    stroke: #0284c7;
    stroke-width: 1.2px;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .collab-diagram__subcard--crdt-core {
    fill: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.05);
    stroke: #38bdf8;
  }

  .collab-diagram__subhead {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  .collab-diagram__code {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    fill: #475569;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .collab-diagram__code {
    fill: #94a3b8;
  }

  .collab-diagram__code-center {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  .collab-diagram__subdesc {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .collab-diagram__server-title,
  .collab-diagram__core-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  .collab-diagram__server-desc,
  .collab-diagram__core-desc {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }

  .collab-diagram__server-note,
  .collab-diagram__core-note {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .collab-diagram__line {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }
  .collab-diagram__line--ot {
    stroke: #d97706;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .collab-diagram__line--ot {
    stroke: #fbbf24;
  }
  .collab-diagram__line--crdt {
    stroke: #0284c7;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .collab-diagram__line--crdt {
    stroke: #38bdf8;
  }

  .collab-diagram__arrow-ot {
    fill: #d97706;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .collab-diagram__arrow-ot {
    fill: #fbbf24;
  }
  .collab-diagram__arrow-crdt {
    fill: #0284c7;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .collab-diagram__arrow-crdt {
    fill: #38bdf8;
  }

  .collab-diagram__pill {
    stroke-width: 1px;
  }
  .collab-diagram__pill--amber {
    fill: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.1);
    stroke: #d97706;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .collab-diagram__pill--amber {
    fill: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.15);
    stroke: #fbbf24;
  }
  .collab-diagram__pill--cyan {
    fill: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.1);
    stroke: #0284c7;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .collab-diagram__pill--cyan {
    fill: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
    stroke: #38bdf8;
  }

  .collab-diagram__pill-text {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  /* Mobile Styles */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .collab-diagram__desktop {
      display: none;
    }

    .collab-diagram__mobile {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .collab-mobile-card {
      background: var(--dg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule-strong);
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: 1rem;
    }
    .collab-mobile-card--amber {
      border-left: 4px solid #d97706;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .collab-mobile-card--amber {
      border-left-color: #fbbf24;
    }
    .collab-mobile-card--cyan {
      border-left: 4px solid #0284c7;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .collab-mobile-card--cyan {
      border-left-color: #38bdf8;
    }

    .collab-mobile-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .collab-mobile-badge--amber {
      color: #d97706;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .collab-mobile-badge--amber {
      color: #fbbf24;
    }
    .collab-mobile-badge--cyan {
      color: #0284c7;
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .collab-mobile-badge--cyan {
      color: #38bdf8;
    }

    .collab-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }

    .collab-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0.35rem 0;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .collab-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      padding: 0.25rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
